        description: "The Conservancy's entry on the Booth House, with preservation status and archival resources.",
      },
      {
        title: "Sherman Booth House #132 — Andrew Pielage Photography",
        url: "https://www.apizm.com/blog/frank-lloyd-wrights-sherman-booth-house",
